Package: backrest
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: web UI and orchestrator for restic backup
 Backrest is a web-accessible backup solution built on top of restic. It
 provides a web interface to create repositories, browse snapshots, restore
 files, and schedule backup, forget and prune operations.
 .
 This package runs backrest as a systemd service and ships the restic
 version it expects in /usr/lib/backrest.
